g","tmdbId":1253794}],"certification":"TV-14","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAbLky6kPvmMYfBV4YKUydjOc4W.jpg","https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Y9N8vS3ongDBDiKqxer1sZzGWk.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt5994364:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"What Kind of a Guardian Are You?","overview":"Se presenta el origen del Goblin —un antiguo general convertido en inmortal— y cómo su destino se entrelaza con el mundo moderno. También conocemos a la protagonista Ji Eun-tak y se establece la idea de la “novia del Goblin”.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mx5YxKTY3PNJhGo1JMITxaBKuvR.jpg","released":"2016-12-02T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"88 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"I'll Become Your Bride in 200 Years","overview":"La conexión entre Eun-tak y el Goblin se intensifica cuando empieza a aparecer en su vida de manera inexplicable. Aparecen personajes clave que convivirán con el Goblin.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LCSJNcM8uiOZa84Oy2ehst8TWg.jpg","released":"2016-12-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"77 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"I See the Sword","overview":"Se profundiza en la vida cotidiana de Eun-tak y su habilidad especial para ver espíritus. El Goblin empieza a mostrar interés y dudas sobre su papel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v95JacsmdRWV0F3GvFzK46lOcgq.jpg","released":"2016-12-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"82 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"I Won't Leave You","overview":"Los personajes principales comienzan a interactuar entre sí de forma más estrecha, y se revelan detalles de la relación entre el Goblin y otro ser sobrenatural importante.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Q4s3KqRoC38ixTDp5w1N6EPOuc.jpg","released":"2016-12-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"I Have to End My Life","overview":"La vida moderna de Eun-tak y su trabajo temporal hacen que se estrechen los lazos entre los protagonistas. El pasado del Goblin sigue siendo un misterio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDB1IKT02J9NBbaj7wWLLG2pGHi.jpg","released":"2016-12-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"67 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Tomorrow","overview":"El vínculo entre Goblin y Eun-tak se vuelve más evidente, y se exploran algunos conflictos internos de los personajes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oBOMMP5EUYeZjM7tcp8iIJ4tfWW.jpg","released":"2016-12-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"76 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"I Think It's Your Face","overview":"La convivencia y dinámica entre los personajes se desarrolla, combinando momentos de humor con reflexiones más profundas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2t43RzvBSFjfGXANLXXsMW8IJ4W.jpg","released":"2016-12-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"74 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"You Gave Her That Fate","overview":"Se exploran más aspectos del pasado del Goblin y se abren nuevas líneas narrativas que afectan a los cuatro protagonistas principales.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2XdmuFEmQYrBz5EsITJzfbOs2zU.jpg","released":"2016-12-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"72 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"He'll Vanish Forever From This World to Another","overview":"El foco empieza a moverse hacia relaciones entre algunos personajes secundarios y sus propios conflictos emocionales.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyHZWIMOvJ2bS54gyJgxshqWMNX.jpg","released":"2016-12-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"78 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Is She Really Your Sister?","overview":"Avanza el desarrollo emocional de los personajes principales y algunos eventos ponen a prueba sus decisiones y deseos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ysPuoVLmdzix5eoAJ33nWL1JCoU.jpg","released":"2016-12-31T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"76 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"The Deity Is So Cruel to You and Me","overview":"Se revelan más verdades sobre la identidad y destino de los protagonistas, conectando pasado con presente.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/HCAXsi0xdn24Wju7aMQmX3rUMu.jpg","released":"2017-01-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"74 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Forget About Me","overview":"La trama empieza a subir de tono, con consecuencias más serias para las relaciones entre los personajes clave.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wSAsOyFvO7jYcKiNf0sh5Pj8SRo.jpg","released":"2017-01-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"83 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:13","season":1,"episode":13,"title":"Protect Her","overview":"Las conexiones pasadas y las revelaciones que surgieron cobran mayor importancia, marcando un punto de inflexión en la historia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cZkX2dwOviXiOJrZZqQ9xG9uact.jpg","released":"2017-01-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"84 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:14","season":1,"episode":14,"title":"Whom Have I Forgotten?","overview":"Los protagonistas enfrentan decisiones difíciles que afectan tanto su presente como su futuro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zGaLvy8Y9bSzfi3SU6cKI8Mex6U.jpg","released":"2017-01-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"75 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:15","season":1,"episode":15,"title":"Will You Be My Bride?","overview":"Se acerca el desenlace de la historia, con eventos que transforman las relaciones, objetivos y destinos de los personajes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5JXnETEvAvmJ79SH27hwQIdCKDK.jpg","released":"2017-01-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"63 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:1:16","season":1,"episode":16,"title":"Goodbye and See You Again","overview":"El cierre de la serie resuelve los viajes personales y los conflictos planteados a lo largo de la historia de forma emotiva y significativa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/okMuAjdEalSLtWyxImCPhi0qGZE.jpg","released":"2017-01-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"73 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:0:1","season":0,"episode":1,"title":"Every Moment of It Shined","overview":"This is a recap of the past 13 episodes. Tune in to watch the most popular scenes and a deep analysis of the main characters. This special is brought to you by Mr. Kim, the late Chairman Yu’s secretary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1sys3HoVU9eJkLhV1OBNMxN3YCk.jpg","released":"2017-01-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"77 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:0:2","season":0,"episode":2,"title":"The Summoning: Part 1","overview":"This special episode provides lots of special clips that will satisfy the viewers who missed the show dearly ever since Goblin has ended. From behind-the-scene footage to summaries of the beautiful love story of each couple, the show will surely make the Goblin fans happy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mJCawy4BwtxRaw9eT8FmpVy50KX.jpg","released":"2017-02-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"77 min"},{"id":"tt5994364:0:3","season":0,"episode":3,"title":"The Summoning: Part 2","overview":"Continuing from the Part 1, Part 2 also provides a lot of special clips that will satisfy the viewers who missed the show dearly ever since Goblin has ended. Part 2 reveals many behind scenes containing ad-libs of the actors, secrets of the character’s makeup and so on. Part 2 will reveal what the viewers have been wondering as they watched Goblin.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/47JOiFY3W6zlzJx4iKJsTsqSJMW.jpg","released":"2017-02-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"77 min"}]}}